      "Label": {
        "text": "Spheres from smooth to rough, plastic in front and metal behind, lit by a dim sun, two point lights - the warm one bobbing and the cold one fading smoothly with camera distance - and a spot light from above. A box with a normal map, one that glows brighter than white. The Environment: ACES tone, glow, fog. The project draws with four samples a pixel."
      }
